886	    /**
887	     * Resolve the fiscal-year number for a date, where the fiscal year starts on 1 July and is
888	     * named for the calendar year in which it ends. A date in July&ndash;December belongs to the
889	     * fiscal year of the next calendar year; a date in January&ndash;June belongs to the fiscal
890	     * year of its own calendar year.
