900	     * Compute an owner's {@code fiscalYear}, the fiscal year of a date formatted {@code 'FY<YY>'}
901	     * where {@code YY} is the last two digits of the fiscal-year number (see
902	     * {@link #fiscalYearNumber(LocalDate)}). The fiscal year starts on 1 July, so a date of
903	     * {@code 2026-08-01} yields {@code 'FY27'} and {@code 2026-03-01} yields {@code 'FY26'}.
904	     *
905	     * @param date the date to derive the fiscal year from, possibly {@code null}
906	     * @return the fiscal year, or {@code null} if {@code date} is {@code null}
907	     */
